   "html": "A Word from Detexpert Paul Cee",
   "inferred": true
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "“It’s great to see the Minelab Vanquish range updated with many of the features seen in more advanced Minelab detectors. The target ID range has been expanded and the discrimination also improved. As an avid beach detectorist I’m also really excited that the range is now fully waterproof. This will open more areas for detecting for a lot of users."
