  {
   "t": "h3",
   "html": "Who Is the Vanquish 60 series For?<br>The 560 is designed for:"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The Upgrader – You’ve started with something basic and now you’re hooked. You want more control, better accuracy, and a bit more robustness."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The Beach detectorist – Full waterproofing and beach mode makes this a dream for beach detecting."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The Budget Power User – Want advanced features like iron bias adjustment and Equinox coil compatibility without spending £1000's This is a detector for you."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The All-Season Detectorist – Rain, rivers, snow? No problem. This machine is ready for it all."
  },
