   "t": "p",
   "html": "The Minelab Vanquish 560 represents a thoughtful and exciting update to the Vanquish range. By retaining the simplicity and power that made the 540 such a success, while adding waterproofing, better discrimination, coil compatibility, and a host of modern touches, the 560 is shaping up to be one of the best value detectors on the market."
  },
